    "text": "1 days ago Founded in 2015, Cute as a Cupcake! Cupcakery & Bake Shop is more than a bakery—it is a celebration of life’s sweetest moments. Based in Merrillville, Indiana, and proudly recognized as a certified Minority/Women-owned Business Enterprise, the company has built a reputation rooted in passion, resilience, and innovation. From its humble beginnings to becoming known for signature creations like “Cupcakes in a Jar,” Cute as a Cupcake continues to elevate and reimagine the dessert experience. Read full article\n1",
